                            <comment id="492558" author="adilger" created="Mon, 6 Apr 2026 22:23:13 +0000">&lt;p&gt;It might make sense to also allow specifying a subsystem-specific debug mask, like &lt;tt&gt;osc.debug&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;mdc.debug&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;lnet.debug&lt;/tt&gt;, ... so that the debug levels can be specified differently for different parts of the code.  If unset (zero), it would inherit the value from the global &lt;tt&gt;libcfs_debug&lt;/tt&gt; variable, but if non-zero it would control the debug logging in that module.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
